    "details": {
      "cr": 1.0,
      "type": {
        "value": "custom",
        "subtype": "",
        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Contenção. Espurr mantém as orelhas fechadas para impedir que seu intenso poder psíquico escape, mas desmaia se a energia se acumular demais. Por trás de sua expressão impassível, ele luta desesperadamente para mantê-la sob controle.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Espurr pode evoluir para Meowstic no nível 9 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Leer, Scratch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Covet</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Confusion</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Light Screen</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Psybeam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Fake Out</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Disarming Voice</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Psyshock</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Reflect</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Ally Switch, Attract, Calm Mind, Charge Beam, Charm, Confide, Covet, Dark Pulse, Disarming Voice, Double Team, Dream Eater, Echoed Voice, Endure, Energy Ball, Expanding Force, Facade, Fake Tears, Frustration, Gravity, Heal Bell, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Iron Tail, Light Screen, Magic Coat, Magic Room, Nasty Plot, Pay Day, Payback, Play Rough, Protect, Psybeam, Psych Up, Psychic, Psychic Noise, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Recycle, Reflect, Rest, Return, Role Play, Round, Safeguard, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snatch, Snore, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Telekinesis, Tera Blast, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Torment, Toxic, Trick, Trick Room, Wonder Room, Work Up, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Assist, Barrier, Tickle, Trick, Yawn</p>",
